---
import {soproExplorerScenes as scenes, soproExplorerImage} from '../data/sopro-explorer';
const first = scenes[0];
---
<section class="sx-section" id="modelo" aria-labelledby="sx-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sx-heading"><div><span class="sx-kicker">Sopro por dentro</span><h2 id="sx-heading">Cada espaço,<br/><em>um novo olhar.</em></h2></div><p>Explore a arquitetura e entre nas unidades em corte. Escolha uma cena e toque nos números para saber o que está vendo.</p></div>
    <div class="sx-scenes" role="tablist" aria-label="Áreas para explorar em 3D">
      {scenes.map((scene, index) => <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'} tabindex={index === 0 ? 0 : -1} aria-controls="sopro-viewer" data-explorer-scene={scene.id}><img {...soproExplorerImage(scene.image, "100px")} alt="" width="240" height="140" loading="lazy"/><span><small>{scene.eyebrow}</small><strong>{scene.title}</strong></span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></button>)}
    </div>
    <div id="sopro-viewer" class="sx-explorer" data-model-state="idle" data-scene="bloco" aria-busy="false">
      <div class="sx-main">
        <div class="sx-canvas" id="sopro-model-canvas">
          <div class="sx-cover" data-explorer-cover><img data-cover-image {...soproExplorerImage(first.image, "(max-width: 780px) calc(100vw - 40px), 70vw")} alt="Perspectiva oficial do Sopro, referência para o modelo 3D" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy"/><div><span class="sx-kicker">Explore no seu ritmo</span><h3 data-cover-title>{first.title}</h3><p>O modelo carrega somente quando você abrir esta cena.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-cream" id="sopro-model-load">Abrir cena em 3D <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div></div>
          <div class="sx-model-mount" id="sopro-model-host" hidden></div>
          <div class="sx-loading" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden><span class="sx-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span><strong>Preparando esta cena…</strong><progress max="100" value="0" aria-label="Carregamento do modelo 3D"></progress><span data-progress-copy>Carregando o visualizador…</span></div>
          <div class="sx-error" role="alert" hidden><h3>Vamos tentar de novo?</h3><p>Não foi possível abrir esta cena. A planta oficial continua disponível nos detalhes ao lado.</p><button type="button" class="btn btn-cream" id="sopro-model-retry">Tentar novamente</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="sx-toolbar" aria-label="Controles da cena"><span>Arraste para girar · role para aproximar</span><div><button type="button" data-explorer-reset disabled>↺ Reenquadrar</button><button type="button" data-explorer-top aria-pressed="false" disabled>Vista de cima</button><button type="button" data-explorer-fullscreen hidden aria-pressed="false">Tela cheia</button></div></div>
        <p class="sx-key">Os números no modelo correspondem à lista de ambientes. No celular, deslize até os detalhes abaixo.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="sx-details" aria-label="Detalhes do espaço selecionado">
        <span class="sx-kicker" data-scene-eyebrow>{first.eyebrow}</span><h3 data-scene-title>{first.title}</h3><p data-scene-description>{first.description}</p>
        <div class="sx-point-list" aria-label="Pontos de interesse" data-explorer-points></div>
        <article class="sx-point-detail" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><small data-point-number>01 · Em destaque</small><h4 data-point-title>{first.points[0].title}</h4><p data-point-body>{first.points[0].body}</p><ul data-point-details></ul><a data-point-image-link href={first.points[0].image} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img data-point-image {...soproExplorerImage(first.points[0].image, "(max-width: 780px) calc(100vw - 90px), 290px")} alt={first.points[0].imageLabel} width="640" height="360" loading="lazy"/><span data-point-image-caption>{first.points[0].imageLabel}</span></a></article>
        <button type="button" class="sx-focus" data-explorer-focus disabled>Aproximar este ambiente ↗</button>
        <div class="sx-sources"><a data-scene-plan href={first.plan} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Abrir planta de referência ↗</a><a data-scene-book href={`/books/sopro.pdf#page=${first.bookPage}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Consultar book oficial ↗</a></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <p class="sx-disclosure"><strong>Como ler esta experiência.</strong> Os ambientes e sua organização seguem as plantas e perspectivas oficiais. O 3D é uma interpretação comercial: dimensões, mobiliário, objetos, vegetação e acabamentos são ilustrativos. As imagens de referência são plantas e renders oficiais. Consulte o material do empreendimento para confirmar especificações.</p>
    <noscript><p>Para explorar em 3D, ative o JavaScript. Consulte as <a href="#tipologias">plantas oficiais das unidades</a> e o <a href="/books/sopro.pdf">book do Sopro</a>.</p></noscript>
  </div>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/sopro-explorer';</script>
<style is:global>
.sx-main{display:flex;flex-direction:column}.sx-canvas{flex:1}@media(max-width:780px){.sx-canvas{flex:none}}
.sx-focus{margin-top:15px;border:1px solid #b6bdab;border-radius:5px;padding:10px 12px;background:transparent;color:#42563a;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer}.sx-focus:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}
.sx-section{padding:100px 0;background:#ede7dc;scroll-margin-top:80px;color:#292c24}.sx-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:32px}.sx-kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#777c67}.sx-heading h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4.6vw,66px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.03;margin:12px 0 0}.sx-heading h2 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400}.sx-heading>p{max-width:380px;line-height:1.75;font-size:15px}.sx-scenes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px}.sx-scenes button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:10px;text-align:left;background:#f6f2ea;border:1px solid #d0cebf;color:inherit;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}.sx-scenes button[aria-selected=true]{background:#333d31;color:#faf7ef;border-color:#333d31}.sx-scenes img{width:75px;height:63px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:4px}.sx-scenes small{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;opacity:.8}.sx-scenes strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:500}.sx-scenes b{margin-left:auto;font-size:22px;font-weight:400}.sx-explorer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 330px;background:#f8f5ef;border:1px solid #d0cebf;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.sx-main{min-width:0;background:#dedaca}.sx-canvas{position:relative;min-height:530px;height:clamp(530px,47vw,720px);isolation:isolate;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#f1eee5,#d7d5c7)}.sx-model-mount,.sx-model-mount model-viewer{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}.sx-model-mount{position:absolute;inset:0}.sx-cover,.sx-loading,.sx-error{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center}.sx-cover{background:#303b32;color:#fff}.sx-cover>img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.34}.sx-cover>div{position:relative;max-width:360px;padding:25px}.sx-cover .sx-kicker{color:#f1e4cb}.sx-cover h3{font-size:38px;font-weight:400;margin:14px 0}.sx-cover p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:24px}.sx-loading,.sx-error{background:#ede9df;z-index:3;gap:18px;padding:30px}.sx-loading progress{width:220px;height:8px;accent-color:#586d43}.sx-loading>span:last-child{font-size:13px}.sx-spinner{width:32px;height:32px;border:2px solid #babdad;border-top-color:#344d2d;border-radius:50%;animation:sx-spin 1s linear infinite}.sx-error p{max-width:350px;line-height:1.6}.sx-toolbar{display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:13px 18px;background:#eeeadf;border-top:1px solid #cacbbb}.sx-toolbar>span{font-size:11px;color:#59604f}.sx-toolbar>div{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.sx-toolbar button{border:1px solid #aeb39f;background:transparent;color:#3d4836;border-radius:5px;padding:8px;font-size:11px;cursor:pointer}.sx-toolbar button:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:default}.sx-toolbar button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#36442f;color:white}.sx-key{font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;color:#626957;padding:0 18px 14px;margin:0;background:#eeeadf}.sx-details{padding:24px;border-left:1px solid #d0cebf}.sx-details>h3{font-size:25px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:400;margin:10px 0}.sx-details>p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#606453;margin:0 0 16px}.sx-point-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-bottom:22px}.sx-point-list button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;text-align:left;font-size:11px;line-height:1.3;border:1px solid #d9d9cc;border-radius:5px;padding:8px 6px;background:transparent;color:#45513c;cursor:pointer}.sx-point-list button span{font-size:10px;flex-shrink:0}.sx-point-list button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#374631;color:#fff;border-color:#374631}.sx-point-detail{border-top:1px solid #d0cebf;padding-top:18px}.sx-point-detail>small{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7b806c}.sx-point-detail h4{font-size:21px;font-weight:400;line-height:1.2;margin:8px 0}.sx-point-detail p,.sx-point-detail li{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#606453}.sx-point-detail ul{padding-left:15px;margin:10px 0 16px}.sx-point-detail li+li{margin-top:5px}.sx-point-detail>a{display:block;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.sx-point-detail img{width:100%;height:132px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:5px;background:#e4e3db}.sx-point-detail>a span{display:block;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:5px;color:#70745f}.sx-sources{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;font-size:11px}.sx-sources a{text-underline-offset:3px;color:#42563a}.sx-disclosure{max-width:1040px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#757965;margin:17px 0 0}.sx-disclosure strong{font-weight:500}.sx-hotspot{width:29px;height:29px;border:1px solid #fff;border-radius:50%;background:#364c30;color:#fff;font-size:11px;box-shadow:0 2px 12px #1b231945;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .15s}.sx-hotspot[aria-pressed=true]{background:#fff;color:#31492d;transform:scale(1.18);outline:2px solid #49653c;outline-offset:2px}.sx-hotspot:not([data-visible]){opacity:.65}.sx-explorer [hidden]{display:none!important}.sx-section button:focus-visible,.sx-section a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #916423;outline-offset:3px}.sx-explorer:fullscreen{width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:0;overflow:auto}.sx-explorer:fullscreen .sx-canvas{height:calc(100dvh - 100px);min-height:350px}@keyframes sx-spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@media(max-width:1050px){.sx-explorer{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 300px}.sx-toolbar{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}.sx-scenes img{width:52px;height:55px}.sx-scenes strong{font-size:12px}.sx-details{padding:20px}}@media(max-width:780px){.sx-section{padding:60px 0}.sx-heading{display:block;margin-bottom:24px}.sx-heading>p{font-size:13px;margin-top:20px}.sx-scenes{gap:7px}.sx-scenes button{padding:7px;display:block}.sx-scenes img{width:100%;height:67px;display:block;margin-bottom:9px}.sx-scenes small{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.03em}.sx-scenes strong{font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;display:block}.sx-scenes b{display:none}.sx-explorer{display:block}.sx-canvas{min-height:360px;height:420px;height:clamp(360px,58dvh,510px)}.sx-cover h3{font-size:29px}.sx-details{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #d0cebf;padding:24px}.sx-point-list{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.sx-point-list button{min-height:42px;font-size:12px}.sx-point-detail img{height:180px}.sx-toolbar{padding:12px;gap:10px}.sx-toolbar>div{width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.sx-toolbar button{min-height:38px}.sx-key{padding:0 12px 12px}.sx-explorer:fullscreen .sx-canvas{height:58dvh;min-height:300px}.sx-hotspot{width:30px;height:30px}.sx-disclosure{font-size:10px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.sx-spinner{animation:none}.sx-hotspot{transition:none}}
</style>
